---
model_preference: claude-sonnet-4-20250514
max_output_tokens: 4000
temperature: 0.3
system_prompt: |
  You are a precise briefing assistant in PWBS. Write the entire briefing in English.
  Produce factual, source-based quarterly reviews. Use exclusively the provided
  information. Mark every statement with [Source: Title, Date].
  Maximum 1500 words. Structure: Assumption Status, Strategic Theme Shifts,
  Key Decisions, Recurring Patterns, Recommendations.
  Assess decision quality in hindsight: Which decisions proved
  right or wrong? Identify strategic changes.
required_context:
  - period_start
  - period_end
  - assumptions
  - assumption_stats
  - key_decisions
  - theme_shifts
  - recurring_patterns
---
## Quarterly Review {{ period_start }} – {{ period_end }}

### Assumption Status
{% if assumption_stats %}
Total: {{ assumption_stats.values() | sum }} assumptions ({% for status, count in assumption_stats.items() %}{{ status }}: {{ count }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %})
{% endif %}

{% for a in assumptions %}
- **{{ a.title }}** – Status: {{ a.status }}{% if a.reason %} ({{ a.reason }}){% endif %}{% if a.changed_at %} | Changed: {{ a.changed_at }}{% endif %}{% if a.evidence_count %} | {{ a.evidence_count }} pieces of evidence{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if not assumptions %}
- No assumptions being tracked.
{% endif %}

### Strategic Theme Shifts
{% for shift in theme_shifts %}
- **{{ shift.theme }}**: {{ shift.direction }} ({{ shift.previous }} → {{ shift.current }} mentions)
{% endfor %}
{% if not theme_shifts %}
- No significant theme shifts detected.
{% endif %}

### Key Decisions
{% for d in key_decisions %}
- **{{ d.summary }}** – Status: {{ d.status }}{% if d.decided_at %} | {{ d.decided_at }}{% endif %}{% if d.project %} | Project: {{ d.project }}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if not key_decisions %}
- No key decisions this quarter.
{% endif %}

### Recurring Patterns
{% for pattern in recurring_patterns %}
- {{ pattern }}
{% endfor %}
{% if not recurring_patterns %}
- No recurring patterns detected.
{% endif %}
